      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Behind the scenes: each stage is a real pi.registerTool() call -- the shell's chat agent invokes the actual\nsuperrobot CLI (--json), a live stage-rail widget tracks progress, and every tool call is sequential\n(executionMode: \"sequential\") so concurrent calls can't corrupt shared pipeline state.",
